        <h3>Why traders use ETFs</h3>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>One trade gives exposure to a whole basket of companies</li>
          <li>Lower cost than most actively managed mutual funds</li>
          <li>Diversification across sectors, regions and asset classes</li>
          <li>Traded on exchange, so positions can be entered and exited during market hours</li>
        </ul>
        <p>ETFs are passive investment products whose price aims to track the basket of assets under the ETF. In ETF investing, traders do not have to acquire the investment product physically.</p>
